    "body": "Does this mean _at least_ once per fragment? Otherwise it is overly restrictive, since a cue fragment may reasonably contain multiple descendant elements that each should be styled as a 'cue' or 'cue background'.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n  <p>The <code data-x=\"attr-cue\">cue</code> and <code data-x=\"attr-cuebackground\">cuebackground</code> attributes must each be present on at least one element in the <var>cueFragment</var>.</p>\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2023-09-27T16:17:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-27T16:25:06Z",
