    "body": "In the explainer we had an abstract concept a \"cue fragment\", so might bring that in... something like:\r\n\r\n> A **cue fragment** is a [DocumentFragment](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment) containing [cue](https://w3c.github.io/webvtt/#css-extensions) text, represented in a limited subset of HTML and styled with CSS with ::cue and ::cue-background.\r\n\r\n",
